      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been on haloperidol for a while now for my schizophrenia, but i've got this massive sinus thing and i can barely breathe through my nose. its totally driving me crazy. my heart has been feeling a little jumpy and fast lately too, but it's probably just the meds, right? i really just want to feel normal for a day so is it okay if i take some sudafed to clear my nose out? how much should i take to make sure it actually works?",
